        "box": [
          38,
          38,
          410.5,
          68.5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Navya looks at Ahana and Vihaan, then steps forward too."
        ],
        "speaker": null,
        "tail": null,
        "tail_source": null
      },
      {
        "block_id": "V02-B0134",
        "panel_id": "CH01-P009-PN02",
        "type": "balloon",
        "box": [
          632,
          36,
          793.7,
          95.2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Good. We volunteered",
          "first and received the",
          "terrifying details second."
        ],
        "speaker": "Vihaan",
        "tail": {
          "edge": "bottom",
          "pos": 727.6157692307693,
          "base": 12,
          "tip": [
            740.4250441135351,
            120.84320669504629
          ],
          "length": 28.664465329517718,
          "aims_at": [
            744,
            128
          ],
          "distance_to_target": 36.7
        },
        "tail_source": "layout-default"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "V02-B0136",
        "panel_id": "CH01-P009-PN03",
        "type": "caption",
        "box": [
          38,
          308,
          413.9,
          402.9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Before Tez takes the volunteers inside, he explains what",
          "ChandRush is. It is a travelling full-moon mela. On",
          "selected full-moon nights, it appears in one city behind a",
          "forgotten gate. It must welcome its visitors, pack itself and",
          "leave before moonset."
        ],
        "speaker": null,
        "tail": null,
        "tail_source": null
      },
      {
        "block_id": "V02-B0137",
        "panel_id": "CH01-P009-PN04",
        "type": "caption",
        "box": [
          466,
          308,
          823.5,
          386.8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "ChandRush works through a simple rule called the",
          "Balance Rule. Its lanterns, food, costumes, games,",
          "buildings and travelling parts depend on correct",
          "numbers, patterns, shapes, measurements and chance."
        ],
        "speaker": null,
        "tail": null,
        "tail_source": null
      }
    ]
  },
