        "type": "caption",
        "box": [
          222.1,
          38,
          546.0,
          132.9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Along the way, he changed number cards, mixed",
          "food labels, swapped costume parts, copied false",
          "repair reports, hid a metal weight inside a game,",
          "turned parts of the Grand Pavilion and sent power",
          "to the sealed launcher on the Moon Deck."
        ],
        "speaker": null,
        "tail": null,
        "tail_source": null
      },
      {
        "block_id": "V02-B0185",
        "panel_id": "CH01-P013-PN02",
        "type": "caption",
        "box": [
          594,
          253.3,
          815.4,
          316.0
        ],
        "lines": [
          "By the time Tara discovered the",
          "theft, the figure and the Bell were",
          "gone."
        ],
        "speaker": null,
        "tail": null,
        "tail_source": null
      },
      {
        "block_id": "V02-B0186",
        "panel_id": "CH01-P013-PN03",
        "type": "caption",
        "box": [
          38,
          364,
          505.2,
          442.8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The volunteers now have two jobs, and the jobs cannot be separated. A",
          "repaired fair cannot leave without the Bell. The Bell cannot safely carry a",
          "damaged fair onto the Moon Path. They must repair ChandRush and",
          "recover the Bell before moonset."
        ],
        "speaker": null,
        "tail": null,
        "tail_source": null
      }
